{"availability":"available","full":"feuerwehr-oberwil/kp-front","name":"kp-front","description":"Tablet-first incident command app (PWA) for Swiss fire services with situation mapping, tactical planning, breathing-apparatus monitoring, etc.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-19T19:40:28Z","updated":"2026-10-05T18:55:36Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://kp-front.ch/","topics":["agpl","emergency-response","firefighting","pwa","self-hosted","situation-map","switzerland"],"demo":"https://demo.kp-front.ch/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:13.872Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:13.872Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:13.872Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:13.872Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Einsatzführungs-app for frontline fire-service command. KP Front replaces the physical Lagekarte and command table with a shared situation map, prepared plans and object data, live documentation, and an offline-capable record.","One operator runs it on a consumer tablet and can share it with the command point using screen mirroring or display mode. KP Front owns its incident state, map, timeline, offline cache, and exports; integrations add data but are not required to operate it.","KP Front grew out of a Swiss Milizfeuerwehr command point. It is designed around one station, one incident, one operator, not scaled down from dispatch-center software."],"features":["Built for Swiss practice. FKS-style tactical symbols, swisstopo geocoding and LV95","Offline-first. Field data is cached, readiness is verified, and edits sync when the","One command surface. Karte, Plan, Checkliste, Trupps, Anwesenheit, Material, Verlauf,","Made for 3am. Recognition over recall, safe defaults, large touch targets, and undo for","Defensible records. Verlauf and audit events are append-only; corrections become new"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/feuerwehr-oberwil/kp-front/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"745c170ceba25f10307d75b04036bd68b58b6e298d4b3ce36c077294079d4f33","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:14.014Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:14.014Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Einsatzführungs-app for frontline fire-service command. KP Front replaces the physical Lagekarte and command table with a shared situation map, prepared plans and object data, live documentation, and an offline-capable record.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/feuerwehr-oberwil/kp-front/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Built for Swiss practice. FKS-style tactical symbols, swisstopo geocoding and LV95","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/feuerwehr-oberwil/kp-front/blob/main/README.md"},{"text":"Made for 3am. Recognition over recall, safe defaults, large touch targets, and undo for","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/feuerwehr-oberwil/kp-front/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Credentials are shown on the login screen.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/feuerwehr-oberwil/kp-front/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Skip to Self-host – this section is the developer machine.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/feuerwehr-oberwil/kp-front/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Development and demo only: log in as user fu (Führungsunterstützung) with PIN 000000, the PIN carried by the bundled backend/app/seedusers.json.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/feuerwehr-oberwil/kp-front/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"A self-hosted installation never gets that PIN: with ENVIRONMENT=production the seeder demands its own SEEDPIN and refuses to boot without one, and 000000 – like 123456 and the other well-known PINs – is rejected outright, whether it arrives as SEEDPIN at boot or through the admin UI's PIN sheet (backend/app/auth/security.py · TRI